3.Pick any app you use daily (like Zomato, Instagram, or Flipkart) and write a short feature request as if you were the product manager.
Then, briefly describe which team members (designer, backend, mobile developer, tester) would be involved in delivering this feature and what each would do.

Feature Request: Save Restaurants for Later

As a Product Manager, I would like to add a “Save Restaurant” feature to the Zomato app.
Users can tap a bookmark icon to save a restaurant and view all their saved restaurants in one place later.

Team Members Involved:

-> Designer: Designs the bookmark button and saved restaurant page.

-> Backend Developer: Creates APIs to save, remove, and fetch saved restaurants.

-> Mobile Developer: Implements the UI and connects it with the APIs.

-> Tester: Tests saving, removing, loading, and error situations.
